      "decision": "considered",
      "rationale": "Prior declared use produced executed task-score retrieval arms, but feedback-aware task routing did not improve click. This is mixed local evidence, not a confirmation of INFNet or a causal estimate of external knowledge value. Full token/hub replacement would confound the immediate selector backward-flow question.",
      "transformed_mechanism": "No new hub or token component adopted; prior task-score rows are retained while a separate gradient-routing adaptation is tested.",
