        "primary_feedback",
        "primary_item",
        "joint_feedback",
        "joint_item"
      ],
      "nearest_work_difference": "Single local-activation pooling stage with selectively blocked backward paths versus stacked task/proxy token interactions and gated broadcasts. Original v1 text and pinned benchmark forward code checked separately.",
